      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 241,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "[Arpesto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 242,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "Did the master send you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 243,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "to me? Hmm... You're still"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 244,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "pretty green from the looks"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 245,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "of it. Yeah, I don't think there's anything I can teach quite yet."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 247,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "[Arpesto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 248,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "Train a little more and get"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 249,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "some more experience in"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 250,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "your job. When you become"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 251,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "more adept at hunting, you'll"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 252,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "be able to grasp what I've been"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 253,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "teaching Hunters and Snipers."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 256,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "[Arpesto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 257,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "Has the master sent you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 258,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "Ah, you definitely have the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 259,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "keen, vulture like eyes of a"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 260,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "true Hunter. You should be"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 261,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "capable of learning my secret"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 262,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "skill, the 3rd Arpesto Form..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 264,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "[Arpesto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 265,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "It's a handy skill that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 266,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "I developed while battling"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 267,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "Medusas and running out"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 268,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "of arrows. I simply call it,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 269,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "''^3131FFEmergency Arrow^000000.'' Would you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 270,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "be interested in learning it?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 272,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "Yes, please!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 272,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "Ummm..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 274,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "[Arpesto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 275,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "Great, great. Of course,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 276,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "you can't resist this offer"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 277,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "if you recognize this skill's"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 278,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "value. However, I'd like to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 279,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "ask for a little tuition in return for me teaching this to you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 281,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "[Arpesto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 282,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "Although I feel guilt at"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 283,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "asking for payment from"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 284,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "a fellow Hunter, creating"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 285,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "this skill required much"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 286,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "sacrifice and unimaginable"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 287,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "bloodshed on my part..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 289,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "[Reidin Corse]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 290,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "Hey! You liar!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 291,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "I was there when you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 292,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "accidently made up that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 293,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "skill when you were bored"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 294,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "and just messing around"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 295,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "with one of the Bows!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 299,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "[Arpesto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 300,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "^333333*Ahem*^000000 Please Reidin,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 301,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "don't entertain unfounded"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 302,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "rumors. It was only after"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 303,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "countless battles with Eddga"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 304,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "that I managed to invent and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 305,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "perfect Emergency Arrow."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 307,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "[Reidin Corse]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 308,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "^333333*Tsk tsk*^000000 Huh."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 309,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "I thought you said"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 310,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "you developed it while"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 311,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "you were fighting Medusas."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 313,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "[Arpesto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 314,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "A-anyway, please bring"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 315,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "me the following items"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 316,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "as tuition in exchange for"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 317,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "me teaching you this skill."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 319,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "[Arpesto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 320,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "Please bring me"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 321,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "^3131FF5 Cursed Rubies^000000,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 322,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "^3131FF30 Pet Foods^000000 and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 323,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "^3131FF5 Harpy Feathers^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 324,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "Then I can teach"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 325,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "you this skill."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 327,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "[Reidin Corse]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 328,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "30 Pet Foods?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 329,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "What the heck do"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 330,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "you need all that for?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 332,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "[Arpesto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 333,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "I..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 334,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "I'm going to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 335,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "use it to feed"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 336,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "my pet Falcon."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 338,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "[Reidin Corse]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 339,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 340,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "......"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 341,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "........."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 342,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "......Riiiight."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 347,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "[Arpesto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 348,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "Alright, it's your"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 349,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "decision. However, I'm"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 350,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "sure that you may have"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 351,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "great need of my skill"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 352,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "sooner or later, so return"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 353,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "to me if you change your mind."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 359,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "[Arpesto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 360,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "The sky still looks clear, but recently the winds that have been blowing through the land seem to carry with them an air of misfortune."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 363,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "[Reidin Corse]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 364,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "So..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 365,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "Danger's coming?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 366,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "Heh! Chill, gramps~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 367,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "I got it covered!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 370,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "[Arpesto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 371,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "Ho ho..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 372,
      "npc" : "Arpesto",
      "text" : "Energetic, but"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 373,
